<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Southwest Gas upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Southwest Gas upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Edward Jones analyst Subash Chandra said he upgraded his recommendation on Southwest Gas Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>--Shares in the natural gas concern closed unchanged at 18-1/8 on the New York Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>--Chandra said the company shows improving fundamentals that suggest it is undervalued.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
